---
---
<section class="impact-quote-section section-padding">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="quote-box relative flex flex-col items-center">
      
      <!-- Dot Pattern SVG Background -->
      <svg
        aria-hidden="true"
        class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 h-full w-full fill-slate-500/20"
      >
        <defs>
          <pattern
            id="dot_pattern_quote"
            width="24"
            height="24"
            patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"
            patternContentUnits="userSpaceOnUse"
            x="0"
            y="0"
          >
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.5" />
          </pattern>
        </defs>
        <rect width="100%" height="100%" stroke-width="0" fill="url(#dot_pattern_quote)" />
      </svg>

      <!-- 4 Glowing Corner Squares -->
      <div class="corner-square top-left"></div>
      <div class="corner-square top-right"></div>
      <div class="corner-square bottom-left"></div>
      <div class="corner-square bottom-right"></div>

      <!-- Content -->
      <div class="quote-content relative z-20 mx-auto max-w-5xl text-center py-12 md:py-20 px-6">
        <p class="quote-badge">A FILOSOFIA NUTRIÇÃO AVANÇADA</p>
        
        <div class="quote-massive">
          <div class="quote-line">
            <span class="font-semibold">"Menos</span>
            <span class="font-thin">calculadora,</span>
          </div>
          <div class="quote-line">
            <span class="font-thin">mais</span>
            <span class="font-semibold highlight-cyan">nutricionista."</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="quote-desc">
          Chega de passar horas calculando dietas em casa no pós-consulta. O método Nutrição Avançada devolve o seu tempo livre, a sua segurança clínica e o verdadeiro brilho dos seus atendimentos.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .impact-quote-section {
    position: relative;
    padding-top: 60px;
    padding-bottom: 60px;
    background: var(--color-bg-primary);
  }

  .quote-box {
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 217, 255, 0.3);
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(6, 17, 29, 0.6) 0%, rgba(2, 7, 13, 0.8) 100%);
    backdrop-filter: blur(28px);
    border-radius: 32px;
    box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), inset 0 1px 2px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* 4 Glowing Corner Squares */
  .corner-square {
    position: absolute;
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    background: var(--color-accent-cyan);
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px 4px var(--color-accent-cyan);
    z-index: 30;
  }

  .top-left { top: -6px; left: -6px; }
  .top-right { top: -6px; right: -6px; }
  .bottom-left { bottom: -6px; left: -6px; }
  .bottom-right { bottom: -6px; right: -6px; }

  /* Content */
  .quote-badge {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    color: var(--color-accent-cyan);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .quote-massive {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 6.5rem;
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .quote-line {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .font-semibold { font-weight: 700; }
  .font-thin { font-weight: 300; opacity: 0.85; }

  .highlight-cyan {
    color: var(--color-accent-cyan);
    text-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(0, 217, 255, 0.4);
  }

  .quote-desc {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .quote-massive { font-size: 5rem; }
    .quote-line { gap: 16px; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .quote-massive { font-size: 3.5rem; }
    .quote-line { gap: 12px; }
    .quote-desc { font-size: 1.15rem; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 576px) {
    .quote-massive { font-size: 2.8rem; }
    .quote-line { gap: 8px; }
    .quote-badge { font-size: 1.05rem; }
  }
</style>
